<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="DAG" id="f497PXfVIiGRyRa88zbP">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1288" dy="778" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="InNB_a3ZEofmuLEvMGXW-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=light-dark(#000000, #ffffff);labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;A DAG (Directed Acyclic Graph) is the core concept of Airflow, collecting Tasks together, organized with dependencies and relationships to say how they should run.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;We treat &lt;b&gt;data pipelines as DAGs&lt;/b&gt;, which means that &lt;b&gt;each DAG will have a set of tasks &lt;/b&gt;that will be responsible for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;extracting,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;loading, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;transforming data from different sources.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;data:image/png;base64,&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;There are several ways of declaring an Apache Airflow DAG, but the most common is by writing a Python file that will be responsible for creating the tasks and setting their dependencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;Solution for code duplication :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;DAG Builder [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;po kh&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;Builder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt; is a creational design pattern that lets you construct complex objects step by step. The pattern allows you to produce different types and representations of an object using the same construction code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;5701&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pl pm kg po b pp pq pr ps pt pu pv pw fm px py pz fp qa qb qc fs qd qe qf qg it cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;There are several manners to implement a DAG Builder which uses mainly two methods:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none none; font-family: medium-content-sans-serif-font, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;74a9&quot; class=&quot;pl pm kg po b pp pq pr ps pt pu pv pw fm px py pz fp qa qb qc fs qd qe qf qg sj sk sl cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; margin-bottom: -0.46em; list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 30px; padding-left: 0px; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 2.14em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;po kh&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Single-file methods: &lt;/span&gt;single Python file generating N DAGs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;8996&quot; class=&quot;pl pm kg po b pp sm pr ps pt sn pv pw fm so py pz fp sp qb qc fs sq qe qf qg sj sk sl cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; margin-bottom: -0.46em; list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 30px; padding-left: 0px; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 1.14em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;po kh&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Multiple-file methods: &lt;/span&gt;one Python file per DAG.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The Single-File DAG Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; A meta-programming or templating approach where one &lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.py&lt;/code&gt; script loops through &lt;span style=&quot;--left-mask-opacity: 1; --right-mask-opacity: 1;&quot; class=&quot;mTEjhd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dteT0b&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr;display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;img aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; src=&quot;data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==&quot; style=&quot;pointer-events: none; position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; left: 0; top: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;inset: 0px; opacity: 0.001; overflow: hidden; position: absolute; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;N&lt;/mi&gt;cap N&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; direction=&quot;ltr&quot; width=&quot;0.714em&quot; height=&quot;0.665em&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 -0.657 0.714 0.665&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: -0.008em; overflow: visible; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;text fill=&quot;#0A0A0A&quot; style=&quot;font-family: STIXTwoMath-Regular; font-size: 1px&quot; transform=&quot;translate(0,0)&quot;&gt;𝑁&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; configurations to dynamically register &lt;span style=&quot;--left-mask-opacity: 1; --right-mask-opacity: 1;&quot; class=&quot;mTEjhd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dteT0b&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr;display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;img aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; draggable=&quot;false&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; src=&quot;data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==&quot; style=&quot;pointer-events: none; position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; left: 0; top: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;inset: 0px; opacity: 0.001; overflow: hidden; position: absolute; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;N&lt;/mi&gt;cap N&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; direction=&quot;ltr&quot; width=&quot;0.714em&quot; height=&quot;0.665em&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 -0.657 0.714 0.665&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: -0.008em; overflow: visible; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;text fill=&quot;#0A0A0A&quot; style=&quot;font-family: STIXTwoMath-Regular; font-size: 1px&quot; transform=&quot;translate(0,0)&quot;&gt;𝑁&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; DAG objects into the orchestrator&#39;s global namespace.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;So in a DAG builder workflow steps can change across different pipelines through the use of dynamic YAML configuration files. While core tasks are standardized, the workflows and TaskCreators components allow for distinct task dependencies and tailored orchestrations per pipeline. You can read the full article at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="2770" width="1040" x="10" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
